-- statement:
--   **Conversion of single-slot chunks.** The merged chunk has exactly the denotation of the
--   `Prop8IfaceR` kernel chunks `frameSteps w L` (`|L|` single-slot children).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6CxMerge`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.Cx.mergedChunk_den_frameSteps (w : R) (L : List (ℤ × (Fin m → ZMod 2)))
--       (hL : ∀ p ∈ L, (p.1 = 1 ∨ p.1 = -1) ∧ p.2 ≠ 0) (hind : LIndep L) :
--       denListH (chEx (κ := κ)) (mergedChunk w L) =
--         denListH (chEx (κ := κ)) ((frameSteps w L).map HStep.ofR)
